+    Input structure:
+    - The board is partitioned into equal 3x3 cell interiors separated by one-color divider lines.
+    - Most cell motifs are all different from one another; exactly one motif family repeats 3-4 times.
+    - Those repeated cells are not noise: they are visible samples of a larger 3x3 source mask.
